等に使いたいのでお手数ですがPSDのデータで、\nキャラレイヤーだけが分かれていると助かります。\n\n使用目的:Youtube配信のサムネイル、デスクトップPCの壁紙鑑賞等\n\n資料:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-GdhDv6dQv3moZeEYIEOc3hH9F9TaKHh\n\n\n以上、ご検討の程、よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@hassan_mofumofu/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039328999617576960%2FWPlZMr3O.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8aa71c8064925b25be2cb31249cc9520", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039328999617576960%2FWPlZMr3O.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8aa71c8064925b25be2cb31249cc9520, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039328999617576960%2FWPlZMr3O.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f12af3ebff7f3b48a897787ed4458dcc 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039328999617576960%2FWPlZMr3O.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b06ead0ac535c3113d7e01830b09bd2d 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2962116, "client_id": 3125616, "nc": 145}, {"path": "/@hassan_mofumofu/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039328999617576960%2FWPlZMr3O.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&cro